Project: lsnmacrofootprint
Type: Project
Title: Computing FIGARO footprints for SINESE
Version: 0.1.0
Author: La Société Nouvelle
Maintainer: La Société Nouvelle <contact@lasocietenouvelle.org>
Description: R scripts to build observed, trend and target direct impact accounts
    and macroeconomic footprints using FIGARO input-output tables.
    Run from the repository root with source("scripts/setup.R"); this project
    is not an installable R package.
License: EUPL-1.2
Encoding: UTF-8
